  "description": "Bright and spacious three bedroom apartments in turn key condition. \r\n\r\nWelcome to Hayfield by OCCU, where the interiors embrace a modern, laid-back vibe with a sophisticated, worldly touch. \r\n\r\nThis design-led concept features bespoke furniture crafted exclusively for the space, blending contemporary cool with a curated, travelled aesthetic. \r\n\r\nThink rich textures, eclectic furnishings, and handcrafted details that come together to tell a story. \r\nThe result is a space that’s effortlessly stylish and full of character, inviting residents to feel at home in an environment as unique and dynamic as they are. \r\n\r\nIncluded in the price is access to our state-of-the-art Resident Amenity Space\r\n\r\n**Note, due to the variety of units available at Hayfield, quoted rents are the entry price point for the unit type**",
  "propertyOverview": [
    {
      "label": "Double Bedroom",
      "text": "3"
